      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Rules:

    The duel will start with a countdown starting at 10 seconds,
    the timer will dissapear after 3 seconds and you have to keep your internal clock
    sharp to get a good shot.


    You want to shoot before your oponent does, but
    not before the countdown is done, or else you''ll get a missfire.


    <size=30>(We
    may not have gotten online to work propperly before the deadline, sorry)

    (Also
    the first snail name you join with online can''t be changed sorry)'
